    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two small squares in love are separated by a locked door and cannot meet. They need to press a mechanism at the same time for the door to open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Control two characters simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Each level features different movement mechanics and various enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Multiple paths to complete the level; try to finish with the fewest steps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual and relaxing mini-game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you will enjoy it</p>",
